  "step_by_step_reasoning": "The architecture shows an analytics ingestion pipeline. Web/Mobile users load a tracking script via CloudFront and send events routed through Route 53 to API Gateway. API Gateway passes events to a validation Lambda function, which buffers data into Kinesis Data Firehose. Firehose writes gzip files to an initial S3 bucket. S3 triggers an SNS notification to an ETL Lambda function, which normalizes the data and writes it to a final output S3 bucket for processing with Spark and EMR.",
